response:
 Avoid any detailed or lengthy elaboration, which will be marked down as plagiarism.
Content Requirements:
5 marks for the text analysis/summary, including:
A clear and logical summary of the relevant information;
A well-structured response;
Effective use of general nouns and active voice (to minimise the extent of plagiarism);
A summary in language that is accessible to the audience.
3 marks for form:
Effective usage of ‘so’ or ‘as a result of’;
Completeness and conciseness. Minimum words of 200 words;
